4
00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:22.135
(narrator) A vintage 1960s mainframe has two large tape reels and a small enlarged cutaway of its core memory: rings threaded on crossing wires.

5
00:00:22.135 --> 00:00:25.705
(narrator) Memory was expensive: dollar bills fly into its core memory.

6
00:00:25.705 --> 00:00:32.785
(narrator) Split-flap digits for 1985 lose their first two digits, only 85 is stored, and a few bills drop back out of the memory.

7
00:00:32.785 --> 00:00:43.732
(narrator) A two-digit field rolls from 99 to 00, and a green-phosphor terminal shows the computer reading 19 plus 00 as 1900, and a desk calendar tears from December 31, 1999 to January 1, 1900.

8
00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:56.702
(narrator) Another terminal file computes an age as 00 minus 85, which is minus 85 years old, while a young man born in 85 rewinds into a teen, a kid, a baby, a newborn, an egg cell, and then a puff of smoke with a question mark.

9
00:00:56.702 --> 00:01:06.400
(narrator) Twelve case files, from payroll to grades, all carry the same red YY secret tag and turn red; an intercept console searches for YY and finds it in file after file.

10
00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:19.727
(narrator) A mission clock turns over to January 1, 2000, celebratory fireworks bloom around it, almost nothing breaks, and red dollar bills fly away from behind a classified expense sheet that totals billions of dollars, stamped paid.

11
00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:26.688
(narrator) A case file gives the title, Every module should keep a secret, stamped top secret, while your hero sits at a laptop.

12
00:01:26.688 --> 00:01:38.349
(narrator) Then the title shrinks into a corner and, as your hero watches, a spy caper plays: two module agents, case files in fedoras and sunglasses, tiptoe in and hide behind newspapers from a searchlight.

13
00:01:38.349 --> 00:01:48.820
(narrator) Agent 007, the Payment Gateway, drops in upside down on a rope, backflips down, and builds a laser barrier between them and the rest of the system, then stands guard beside it.

14
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:53.699
(narrator) A nosy third agent tries to peek, gets zapped, and asks the gateway agent instead.

15
00:01:53.699 --> 00:01:58.756
(narrator) Everyone says shh, the agent raises his martini, and the scene is stamped classified.

16
00:01:58.756 --> 00:02:03.667
